   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research and Training Center for Community Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aims at promoting a healthy lifestyle without alcohol in Vietnam by strengthening women&#x2019;s and communities&#x2019; role in alcohol harm prevention and building capacity among local communal authorities. Targeting women and vulnerable community groups, the project seeks increased community participation and a measurable shift in attitudes and behaviours toward alcohol use. Activities include capacity building for local initiatives, awareness-raising, knowledge-sharing discussions and community meetings in Ha Noi city and Ninh Binh provice.</narrative>
  </description>
